# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Pauli propagation"
msgstr "Installationsanleitung für die neueste Version von Pauli-Propagation"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "Installationsanleitung"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "Installationsanleitung {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Voraussetzungen {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. We recommend using [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Erstelle zunächst eine minimale Umgebung, in der nur Python installiert ist. Wir empfehlen die Verwendung von [virtuellen Python-Umgebungen](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Aktiviere deine neue Umgebung.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two primary ways to install this package – from PyPI or source. The preferred method is to install from PyPI:\n"
msgstr "Es gibt zwei Hauptwege, dieses Paket zu installieren – über PyPI oder aus dem Quellcode. Die bevorzugte Methode ist die Installation über PyPI:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Über PyPI installieren {#install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from source {#install-from-source}"
msgstr "Aus dem Quellcode installieren {#install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can install from source if you want to develop in the repository or run the notebooks locally.\n"
msgstr "Du kannst aus dem Quellcode installieren, wenn du im Repository entwickeln oder die Notebooks lokal ausführen möchtest.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, clone the `pauli-prop` repository.\n"
msgstr "Klone zunächst das Repository `pauli-prop`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, install the Rust toolchain, upgrade pip, and enter the repository. Refer to the [Rust documentation](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) for instructions on installing the toolchain.\n"
msgstr "Installiere als Nächstes die Rust-Toolchain, aktualisiere pip und wechsle in das Repository. Anweisungen zur Installation der Toolchain findest du in der [Rust-Dokumentation](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `pauli-prop` to the virtual environment. Install the notebook dependencies if you want to run all the visualizations in the notebooks. If you plan on developing in the repository, you can install the `dev` dependencies.\n"
msgstr "Der nächste Schritt ist die Installation von `pauli-prop` in der virtuellen Umgebung. Installiere die Notebook-Abhängigkeiten, wenn du alle Visualisierungen in den Notebooks ausführen möchtest. Wenn du im Repository entwickeln willst, kannst du die `dev`-Abhängigkeiten installieren.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the options below to suit your needs.\n"
msgstr "Passe die folgenden Optionen an deine Bedürfnisse an.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you installed the notebook dependencies, you can get started by running the notebooks in the docs.\n"
msgstr "Wenn du die Notebook-Abhängigkeiten installiert hast, kannst du loslegen, indem du die Notebooks in der Dokumentation ausführst.\n"
